WEBVTT

00:00:00.543 --> 00:00:02.605
Narrator: You see one gate.

00:00:02.811 --> 00:00:07.348
Narrator: The venue control room - the VOC - sees the whole stadium.

00:00:11.085 --> 00:00:14.649
Narrator: A queue at your gate might be one of three.

00:00:14.841 --> 00:00:20.235
Narrator: Only the VOC can join the dots - but only if your message reaches them.
